---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Privacy Policy & Terms — English Vidya"
description: "English Vidya Privacy Policy, Disclaimer & Terms of Service."
permalink: /legal/
bodyClass: page-legal
---

<style>
  .legal-container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 40px auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }
  
  .legal-hero {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  
  .legal-hero h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  
  .legal-hero p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* Language Toggle */
  .lang-controls {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .lang-toggle {
    display: flex;
    background: var(--bg-raised);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 4px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .lang-btn {
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .lang-btn.active {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    color: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    cursor: default;
  }

  .lang-btn:not(.active):hover {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  /* Accordion UI */
  .legal-accordion {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .legal-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .legal-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    border-color: var(--border-hover);
  }

  .legal-card-header {
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    background: var(--bg-raised);
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: left;
    transition: background 0.3s ease;
  }

  .legal-card-header:hover {
    background: rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.04);
  }

  .legal-card-title {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: var(--text-main);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .legal-card-icon {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .legal-card.active .legal-card-icon {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }

  .legal-card-content {
    max-height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: max-height 0.3s ease-out;
  }

  .legal-card.active .legal-card-content {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .legal-card-inner {
    padding: 24px;
  }

  .rule-card {
    background: var(--bg-raised);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  
  .rule-card:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .rule-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 8px;
    background: var(--bg-base);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .rule-title {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
  }

  .rule-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .rule-list li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .rule-list li:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .rule-list li::before {
    content: "✅";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 2px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  
  .rule-list.danger li::before {
    content: "🚫";
  }

  .rule-list.heart li::before {
    content: "❤️";
  }

  .highlight-box {
    background: rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.05);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
</style>

<div class="legal-container">
  
  <div class="lang-controls">
    <div class="lang-toggle">
      <a href="/legal/" class="lang-btn active">English</a>
      <a href="/legal-hindi/" class="lang-btn">हिंदी</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="legal-hero">
    <h1>Legal & Policies</h1>
    <p>Welcome to English Vidya! We have explained our privacy policy and rules in simple language below.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="legal-accordion">
    <!-- PRIVACY POLICY CARD -->
    <div class="legal-card">
      <button class="legal-card-header" aria-expanded="false">
        <span class="legal-card-title">🔒 Privacy Policy</span>
        <span class="legal-card-icon">▼</span>
      </button>
      <div class="legal-card-content">
        <div class="legal-card-inner">
          <div class="highlight-box">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0; color: var(--accent);">We Respect Your Privacy!</h3>
            <p style="margin:0; color: var(--text-secondary);">Your personal data (like email or personal diary) is completely safe. We do not sell it to any 3rd-party company.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="rule-card">
            <div class="rule-icon">👤</div>
            <h3 class="rule-title">What data do we collect?</h3>
            <ul class="rule-list">
              <li><strong>Google Account Data:</strong> When you login with Google, we only take your Name, Email ID, and Profile Photo to create your account.</li>
              <li><strong>Public Data:</strong> The comments you make on the website, or the questions you ask in the forum, are public and everyone can see them.</li>
              <li><strong>Private Data:</strong> Your "Personal Notes" (diary) and "Bookmarks" are completely private. No other user can see them.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="rule-card">
            <div class="rule-icon">🛡️</div>
            <h3 class="rule-title">What permissions do Admins have?</h3>
            <ul class="rule-list">
              <li>Our Admins can only see your public data (your comments, forum posts, and name).</li>
              <li><strong>No Admin or website owner can read your Personal Notes or Bookmarks.</strong> They are fully secure in the system.</li>
              <li>Admins only work to protect the website from spam and maintain a healthy environment.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="rule-card">
            <div class="rule-icon">🗑️</div>
            <h3 class="rule-title">Account Deletion</h3>
            <ul class="rule-list">
              <li>You can submit an account deletion request anytime by visiting Settings.</li>
              <li>Upon deletion, your name, email, and photo will be completely erased from the system within <strong>30 days</strong>.</li>
              <li>Comments made by you will remain on the website (to help others), but your name will be removed from them (they will become Anonymous).</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- TERMS OF SERVICE CARD -->
    <div class="legal-card">
      <button class="legal-card-header" aria-expanded="false">
        <span class="legal-card-title">⚖️ Terms of Service</span>
        <span class="legal-card-icon">▼</span>
      </button>
      <div class="legal-card-content">
        <div class="legal-card-inner">
          <div class="highlight-box" style="border-left-color: #ff4757; background: rgba(255, 71, 87, 0.05);">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0; color: #ff4757;">Community Rules</h3>
            <p style="margin:0; color: var(--text-secondary);">English Vidya is an educational platform. To keep it clean and focused, some strict rules have been made.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="rule-card">
            <div class="rule-icon" style="background: rgba(255,71,87,0.1); color: #ff4757;">🚫</div>
            <h3 class="rule-title" style="color: #ff4757;">Strictly Prohibited</h3>
            <ul class="rule-list danger">
              <li><strong>Abuse:</strong> Use of any kind of abusive language, swearing, or disrespectful remarks.</li>
              <li><strong>Religion & Politics:</strong> Commenting or making forum posts about any religion, god, politician, or political party (like BJP, Congress, etc.).</li>
              <li><strong>Spam:</strong> Sending meaningless messages, self-promotion, or advertising another product.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="rule-card">
            <div class="rule-icon">❤️</div>
            <h3 class="rule-title">Respect & Love</h3>
            <ul class="rule-list heart">
              <li>Live with love, respect each other, and use this platform <strong>ONLY</strong> for the purpose of learning English.</li>
              <li>If a user repeatedly violates the rules, their account features may be restricted to maintain a healthy learning environment.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="rule-card">
            <div class="rule-icon">🔗</div>
            <h3 class="rule-title">Reference Links</h3>
            <ul class="rule-list">
              <li>If you provide a link to another website in the comments or forum, it will not go live immediately.</li>
              <li>The link first goes into "Pending" mode. It will only be visible to others when our <strong>Admins check and approve it</strong>.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- DISCLAIMER CARD -->
    <div class="legal-card">
      <button class="legal-card-header" aria-expanded="false">
        <span class="legal-card-title">⚠️ Disclaimer</span>
        <span class="legal-card-icon">▼</span>
      </button>
      <div class="legal-card-content">
        <div class="legal-card-inner">
          <div class="rule-card">
            <div class="rule-icon">📚</div>
            <h3 class="rule-title">1. Educational Purpose Only</h3>
            <ul class="rule-list">
              <li>All study material, dictionaries, and lessons available on English Vidya are for educational purposes only.</li>
              <li>We do not give any legal guarantee of 100% success in any type of examination or job interview.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="rule-card">
            <div class="rule-icon">✏️</div>
            <h3 class="rule-title">2. Accuracy & Errors</h3>
            <ul class="rule-list">
              <li>We have taken full care in compiling the 19,000+ words and grammar rules, yet human errors (Typing Mistakes) may occur.</li>
              <li>Students are requested to cross-check facts once before important exams.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="text-align: center; color: var(--text-tertiary); margin-top: 40px; font-size: 0.9rem;">
    Last updated: June 2026<br>
    Governing Law: Jurisdiction of Supaul, Bihar, India.
  </p>
</div>

<script>
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
  const headers = document.querySelectorAll('.legal-card-header');

  headers.forEach(header => {
    header.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const card = header.parentElement;
      const isExpanded = card.classList.contains('active');
      
      // Toggle current card
      card.classList.toggle('active');
      header.setAttribute('aria-expanded', !isExpanded);
      
      const content = card.querySelector('.legal-card-content');
      if (card.classList.contains('active')) {
        content.style.maxHeight = content.scrollHeight + "px";
      } else {
        content.style.maxHeight = "0";
      }
    });
  });
});
</script>
